 onClose arg
⍝ Records the end of a session so a surviving one can see it happened.
⍝ Total, because EWC calls this untrapped on the graceful-close path, and
⍝ held, because it runs on the Listen thread while sessions read the log.

 :Trap 0
     :Hold 'MULTITESTLOG'
         #.multitestlog.closed,←⊂⍕⎕THIS
     :EndHold
 :EndTrap
